16:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 text-lg leading-8","children":["$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"font-medium text-ink","children":"A woman dials 911 three separate times after a McDonald's runs out of Chicken McNuggets and won't give her a refund."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 text-ink-soft","children":"Latreasa Goodman, 27, of Fort Pierce, called 911 three times on February 28, 2009, after a McDonald's on U.S. 1 told her they'd run out of Chicken McNuggets and refused to refund the $4.20 she'd already paid. 'This is an emergency,' she told the dispatcher on one call. 'If I would have known they didn't have McNuggets, I wouldn't have given my money, and now she wants to give me a McDouble, but I don't want one.' Police cited Goodman for misuse of the 911 system, a misdemeanor. A McDonald's spokesman later said she should have gotten her refund and sent her a gift card for a free meal."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 rounded-xl bg-paper-soft p-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-ink","children":"Score breakdown"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4","children":[["$","div","Absurdity",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Absurdity"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#FF6B35"},"children":[20,"/",25]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"h-2.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"h-full rounded-full","style":{"width":"80%","backgroundColor":"#FF6B35"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Humor",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Humor"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#FFC93C"},"children":[22,"/",25]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"h-2.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"h-full rou